    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"sidebar-container\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r3473735\">.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox{border-radius:0;font-size:0.875em;line-height:1.1;margin:0.5em auto;padding:0;width:270px}@media(max-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox{clear:none;float:none}.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox .nowrap{white-space:normal}}@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox{clear:right;float:right;margin-left:1em;margin-right:0}}.mw-parser-output .pi-background{background:var(--ma-custom-accent-color)}.mw-parser-output .pi-secondary-background{background:var(--ma-custom-base-color)linear-gradient(var(--ma-custom-table-header-color),var(--ma-custom-base-color));color:var(--ma-custom-heading-color)}.mw-parser-output .pi-border-color{border-top-color:var(--theme-border-color);border-right-color:var(--theme-border-color);border-bottom-color:var(--theme-border-color);border-left-color:var(--theme-border-color)}.mw-parser-output .pi-item-spacing{padding:3px}.mw-parser-output [data-item-name=\"halfwidth\"] .pi-image-thumbnail{max-width:50%}.mw-parser-output .pi-horizontal-group{margin:0}html:root .mw-parser-output .pi-horizontal-group .pi-header{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .pi-data-value,.mw-parser-output .pi-data-label{hyphens:none}.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox .pi-section-tab{background:none}.mw-parser-output .pi-panel-scroll-wrapper::before,.mw-parser-output .pi-panel-scroll-wrapper::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .pi-image{padding:0}.mw-parser-output .pi-image .article-media-thumbnail{background:none;border:none;float:none;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .pi-image .article-media-placeholder{border:none;margin:0;max-width:268px}.mw-parser-output .pi-caption{color:inherit;font-size:1em;font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .pi-layout-stacked .pi-data-value{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .pi-layout-stacked .pi-data-label{text-align:center;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .pi-layout-stacked .pi-data-value .plainlist ul{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .pi-font,.mw-parser-output .pi-secondary-font,.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox .pi-data-label{font-size:1em;line-height:1.1}.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox .pi-title{font-size:1.4em;padding:0.7em}.mw-parser-output .pi-group{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .portable-infobox .pi-header{font-size:1.1em;padding:0.7em}.mw-parser-output .pi-navigation{text-align:center;font-weight:normal}</style>\n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/memoryalpha/images/f/f1/Spock_inhabited_by_Henoch.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20090320113417&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Henoch in Spock&#39;s body in 2268\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/memoryalpha/images/f/f1/Spock_inhabited_by_Henoch.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20090320113417&amp;path-prefix=en\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/memoryalpha/images/f/f1/Spock_inhabited_by_Henoch.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20090320113417&amp;path-prefix=en 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/memoryalpha/images/f/f1/Spock_inhabited_by_Henoch.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20090320113417&amp;path-prefix=en 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Henoch in Spock&#39;s body in 2268\" width=\"270\" height=\"204\" data-image-key=\"Spock_inhabited_by_Henoch.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Spock inhabited by Henoch.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arretan\" title=\"Arretan\">Arretan</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deceased\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deceased\">Deceased</a> <i><small class=\"\">(<a href=\"/wiki/2268\" title=\"2268\">2268</a>)</small></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Died:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/2268\" title=\"2268\">2268</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><i>Played by</i>:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"italic\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leonard_Nimoy\" title=\"Leonard Nimoy\">Leonard Nimoy</a></div></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p><b>Henoch</b> was an <a href=\"/wiki/Arretan\" title=\"Arretan\">Arretan</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Male\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Male\">male</a> who was the last survivor of the rival faction to that of <a href=\"/wiki/Sargon\" title=\"Sargon\">Sargon</a>.\n</p><p>Henoch was a friendly and charismatic individual, who, despite his pleasant demeanor displayed psychopathic and sociopathic tendencies, who had no qualms about <a href=\"/wiki/Murder\" title=\"Murder\">murdering</a> and manipulating those around him, and abusing the abilities Spock's Vulcan body gave him.\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/2268\" title=\"2268\">2268</a>, Henoch occupied <a href=\"/wiki/Spock\" title=\"Spock\">Spock</a>'s body and decided that he would not give it up. He used Spock's <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_meld\" title=\"Mind meld\">mind meld</a> abilities to confuse <a href=\"/wiki/Nurse\" title=\"Nurse\">Nurse</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Christine_Chapel\" title=\"Christine Chapel\">Chapel</a> so that she would administer a worthless metabolic formula to Sargon occupying <a href=\"/wiki/Captain\" title=\"Captain\">Captain</a> <a href=\"/wiki/James_T._Kirk\" title=\"James T. Kirk\">Kirk</a>'s body, so that Sargon and Kirk would die. He then took control of the <a href=\"/wiki/USS_Enterprise_(NCC-1701)\" title=\"USS Enterprise (NCC-1701)\">USS <i>Enterprise</i></a>. When the doctor tried to <a href=\"/wiki/Intravenous\" title=\"Intravenous\">inject</a> him with a (supposedly) deadly <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">poison</a>, Henoch ordered Nurse Chapel to inject the doctor. She seemed to follow this order, but as Spock's consciousness inhabited Chapel's mind, she was able to resist and inject Spock's body instead. \n</p><p>Henoch in Spock's body immediately perceived Sargon as being alive when he was injected. Henoch had presumed Sargon dead. Henoch then left Spock's body and tried to transfer to another body, but was stopped by Sargon, so his consciousness died. The injection had not really been deadly, as it was used as a ploy to drive Henoch from Spock's body. (<a href=\"/wiki/Star_Trek:_The_Original_Series\" title=\"Star Trek: The Original Series\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Star Trek: The Original Series\">TOS</span></a>: \"<a href=\"/wiki/Return_to_Tomorrow_(episode)\" title=\"Return to Tomorrow (episode)\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Return to Tomorrow (TOS 2x22)\">Return to Tomorrow</span></a>\")\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r3484013\">.mw-parser-output .bginfo{border:1px dotted #666666;margin-top:1em;margin-right:1em;margin-bottom:1em}@media(max-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .bginfo{margin-left:1em}}@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .bginfo{margin-left:3em}}.mw-parser-output .bginfo .bginfo-paragraph{margin:0.5em;font-family:cambria,serif;font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .bginfo i{font-style:normal}</style><div class=\"bginfo\"><div class=\"bginfo-paragraph\">Henoch was played by <a href=\"/wiki/Leonard_Nimoy\" title=\"Leonard Nimoy\">Leonard Nimoy</a>.</div><div class=\"bginfo-paragraph\">The name Henoch is a variation of the Biblical name <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enoch\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Enoch\">Enoch</a>.</div><div class=\"bginfo-paragraph\">His name was spelled Hanoch in the novelization.</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260823063952\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 559/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3240/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 826/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 12/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/300\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2994/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.051/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 999773/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   95.456      1 -total\n 72.47%   69.178      1 Template:Sidebar_individual\n 55.89%   53.354      1 Template:Sidebar\n 15.95%   15.223      1 Template:TOS\n 12.88%   12.297      2 Template:Linktip\n 12.77%   12.190      1 Template:Episode\n 11.08%   10.576      1 Template:Titles\n  8.91%    8.501      1 Template:Bginfo\n  2.41%    2.305      1 Template:USS\n  1.65%    1.573      1 Template:Small\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_enmemoryalpha:pcache:idhash:25807-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260823063952 and revision id 3444389. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
